"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Installer {title}\n"
"\n"
"Anbefalet: Føj til systemet. I en boks fungerer disse dele af {title} ikke:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"På systemet fungerer alt. Kræver din adgangskode og en genstart.\n"
"\n"
"Eller {setup}: lægger det i en separat boks. Det er nemmere at fjerne, men de dele vil ikke fungere."

