#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Dette sletter virkelig disse filer fra denne computer: brugerkonti og adgangskoder (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), listen over diske (/etc/fstab), loginreglerne (/etc/pam.d) og administratorreglerne (/etc/sudoers). Dine egne filer og apps bliver ikke rørt.\n"
"\n"
"Gem dit arbejde, og luk dine apps først: Computeren genstarter, så snart de er slettet.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis det ikke virker at sætte dem tilbage: Når opstarten hænger eller forbliver defekt, skal du holde tænd/sluk-knappen nede, indtil computeren slukker, og derefter tænde den igen. Efter 2 mislykkede opstarter er den næste opstart den tidligere version, der er gemt til Fortryd den seneste opdatering, og som har sin egen kopi af disse indstillinger."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Når den kommer tilbage, siger en meddelelse, at testen virkede, og testkopien fjernes. Sluk ikke computeren under testen, medmindre trinnene siger det. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Testkopien tager pladsen for den tidligere version, der er gemt til Fortryd den seneste opdatering, så Fortryd ikke har noget at gå tilbage til før næste opdatering."

