msgstr "Vis NVIDIA-grafik som fin i egnethedstjekket"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Load the file systems before installing"
msgstr "Indlæs filsystemerne før installation"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ask before an automatic restart"
msgstr "Spørg før en automatisk genstart"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Mark every new version for trial"
msgstr "Markér hver ny version til prøve"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Roll back an update when something that worked breaks"
msgstr "Tilbagefør en opdatering, når noget, der virkede, går i stykker"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start every build in a virtual machine before publishing"
msgstr "Start hver build i en virtuel maskine før udgivelse"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recommend 8 GB of memory, with no minimum"
msgstr "Anbefal 8 GB hukommelse uden minimum"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Check the computer before installing from the live USB"
msgstr "Tjek computeren før installation fra live-USB"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ask Windows or Linux user in the installer"
msgstr "Spørg om Windows- eller Linux-bruger i installationsprogrammet"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add System Tools to the logo menu"
msgstr "Tilføj Systemværktøjer til logomenuen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add six more topics to the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Tilføj seks emner mere til EvenKeelOS-vejledningen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Turn New to Linux into the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Gør Ny til Linux til EvenKeelOS-vejledningen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add the New to Linux guide in System Tools and at login"
msgstr "Tilføj vejledningen Ny til Linux i Systemværktøjer og ved login"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Boot options: common fixes and your own settings"
msgstr "Tilføj Opstartsindstillinger: almindelige rettelser og dine egne indstillinger"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the Shared folders build check: no home folders yet"
msgstr "Ret byggetjekket for Delte mapper: ingen hjemmemapper endnu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Shared folders: share home folders on Home networks"
msgstr "Tilføj Delte mapper: del hjemmemapper på hjemmenetværk"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Network safety: Home, Work or Public place"
msgstr "Tilføj Netværkssikkerhed: Hjem, Arbejde eller Offentligt sted"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize printer drivers in any folder"
msgstr "Genkend printerdrivere i enhver mappe"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show tool windows inside System Tools"
msgstr "Vis værktøjsvinduer inde i Systemværktøjer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open an issue when the image build fails"
msgstr "Opret en sag, når bygningen af imaget fejler"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Lock outside packages and the ISO tool to exact versions"
msgstr "Lås eksterne pakker og ISO-værktøjet til bestemte versioner"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Name tool windows after the tool, shorter test list"
msgstr "Navngiv værktøjsvinduer efter værktøjet, kortere testliste"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Repair deleted system settings and alert on certificates"
msgstr "Reparér slettede systemindstillinger og advar om certifikater"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Saml alle værktøjer i ét Systemværktøjer-vindue"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "Efterlad intet, når et VPN fjernes"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Tilføj Hent et VPN, med VPN'er der bliver opdateret"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Giv Zoom-møder deres egen vejledning"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Åbn Zoom-møder i Chrome, i Zooms webversion"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Forhindr, at ArtCraft-installationer ødelægger Flathub-installationer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Genkend installationsprogrammer på deres sædvanlige filnavn"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Foreslå Linux-alternativer til Windows-programmer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Ret opsætning af boks: distrobox monterer skrivebeskyttede mapper forkert"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Tilbyd Fedora- eller Ubuntu-versioner af Windows-programmer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Tilbyd Linux-versionen, når et Windows-program åbnes"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Medlever én shim, så firmware ikke tilføjer en ekstra Fedora-post"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Sæt Fedoras firewallzone tilbage"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Gør rodhjælpere, firewall og opdateringer uden adgangskode mere sikre"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Nye standarder: baggrundsbilleder, accentmapper, låseskærm"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Ny standard: blågrøn accentfarve, også på loginskærmen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Ret tilbageførselsnote, login-løkke og hængende tests"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Ret tilbageførsel ved frys og skær forsøg ned til 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Ret testene af automatisk tilbageførsel"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Rigtige fejltests til automatisk tilbageførsel"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Tilføj automatisk tilbageførsel med greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Start Windows-layoutet på skrivebordet, plus små rettelser"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Sæt automatiske opdateringer på pause i 3 dage efter en fortrydelse"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Tilføj et trin til skrivebordslayout i installationsprogrammet"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Tilføj Skrivebordslayout til Systemværktøjer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Lad skift af strømtilstand slippe for at vente på opdateringer"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Tilføj et valgfrit layout i Windows-stil"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Ret Fedora 45-forudindstillinger og containerpolitikstier"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Læs downloadkilder i Fedora 45's nye mappe"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Skift til Fedora 45"
